WEBVTT

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:39.650
What I want is Kaito.

00:01:42.590 --> 00:01:46.710
The thing I want most is Kaito's heart.

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:49.430
Kaito's heart...

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:05.630
I couldn't help but eavesdrop on them.

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:07.790
Like I thought, Lucia still loves Kaito.

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:08.550
Yeah.

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:11.470
Can't we do something for them?

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:15.840
Fortune of Love

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:34.950
If you would, Lady Bat.

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:36.950
I understand, Mikeru-sama.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:39.430
Please leave this to me.

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:41.430
I've already set the perfect plan into motion.

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:48.780
I will definitely bring the Mermaid Princesses under your white wings.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:55.030
I'm serious this time, Mermaid Princesses.

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:57.030
Brace yourselves.

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:04.240
Now, then.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:06.700
Lucia. Hanon.

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:09.540
Why don't we go out for a cup of tea?

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:10.130
Shh!

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:11.950
Look.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:13.790
What's going on?

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:20.940
Kaito returned to Rihito-san's house after all and he still doesn't remember me.

00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:29.880
No matter how hard I try, the gap between us is widening even further.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:37.630
Kaito.

00:03:55.550 --> 00:04:03.570
Recently, I've been feeling that there are many things that I can't get, no matter how much I want them.

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:05.000
Lucia.

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.610
You're wrong, Lucia!

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:08.020
You shouldn't think like that.

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:10.180
During times like these, you need this!

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:13.320
"Love Fortune House" grand opening?

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:14.630
Let me see.

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:17.420
"The goddess of fortune will smile upon you."

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:21.980
Let's have the goddess of fortune smile on you!

00:04:27.230 --> 00:04:32.500
You know, I have an extraordinary ability when it comes to love.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:35.160
It's all right, this fortune-teller must be accurate.

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:36.780
That's what my nose is telling me.

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:42.540
Hmm, this flyer says the Love Fortune House should be around here.

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:43.970
Oh, there it is.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:45.510
Found it!

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:52.650
There wasn't a tent like this here yesterday.

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:53.620
Yeah.

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:58.620
We should be careful. We don't want to fall for another trap like the karaoke parlor from before.

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:01.540
My goodness! That was so surprising!

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:04.220
Everything she said about us was true!

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:07.400
Yeah! We didn't tell her anything, so I was really surprised!

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:14.980
So that means that if we complete the ritual, our romantic future will be rosy!

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.560
It looks like she's genuine.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:21.050
Yeah, she seems like it.

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:25.240
Hanon, the watchdog of love, never makes mistakes.

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:26.960
The watchdog of love?

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:30.080
Don't you mean "hunting dog?"

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:33.620
Hey, don't worry about such a little mistake.

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:34.800
Come on, let's go inside.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:45.340
Would the person who is troubled please step forward.

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:49.360
Go on, Lucia. The goddess of fortune is calling you. Hurry!

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:50.440
Okay.

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.430
U-Uhh.

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:56.280
You are currently suffering from lovesickness.

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:57.380
Y-Yes.

00:05:57.380 --> 00:05:59.380
Please have a seat.

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:07.290
Of course everyone who comes to the Love Fortune House is lovesick.

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:11.410
Shhh! A fortune-teller needs a bluff to make a good impression.

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:13.790
The actual content of the fortune is more important.

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:17.140
Now, tell me what has made you lovesick.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:17.960
Okay.

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:22.980
Due to an accident, the person I like has lost all memory of me.

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:25.770
Oh. It causes you pain.

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:28.770
You want him to remember you, no matter what.

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:29.590
Yeah.

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:30.610
I see.

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:33.250
Then please have a look at this.

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:40.300
Oh my! I'm so excited to see her specialty!

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:57.990
It's weird.

00:06:58.820 --> 00:07:01.160
Somehow, I feel so wonderful.

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:06.010
I feel like I can tell her everything.

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:10.300
I see a wonderful destiny.

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:15.190
You and he are bound together. Is that right?

00:07:15.190 --> 00:07:15.830
Yeah.

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:21.310
He nearly drowned and I saved him. That was the first time I met him.

00:07:21.310 --> 00:07:23.970
Then you met at sea.

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:24.870
Yeah.

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:26.120
Hey, Hanon.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:28.630
Lucia looks strange.

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:30.530
What does she plan on saying?

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:32.680
I'm getting a really bad feeling about this.

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:34.420
That's because I'm...

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:35.980
Because you are...

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:37.980
Because I'm a Mer...

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:45.500
Stop it!

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:52.720
I will teach you a ritual to grant your wish.

00:07:53.150 --> 00:07:59.150
When you complete this ritual, the goddess of fortune will smile upon you.

00:07:59.150 --> 00:08:01.280
What is it? What is it? What should she do?

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:03.280
The ritual is really easy to do.

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:06.350
But it is also said to be one of the most difficult things to do.

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:10.110
Huh? Stop beating around the bush!

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:12.110
Yes! Please!

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:16.050
I'll do anything to recover Kaito's memories.

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:17.460
Very well.

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:21.270
Then the ritual to grant your wish is...

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:22.430
Is?

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:25.910
...is to throw your most treasured possession into the sea.

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:31.520
When you do this, your wish will come true and his memories will return.

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:38.480
When I throw my most treasured possession into the sea, Kaito's memories will return?

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:39.960
Are you sure?

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:42.830
It is your choice whether you choose to believe it or not.

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:47.650
The goddess will only smile upon those who believe in her.

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:57.990
Kaito.

00:09:04.490 --> 00:09:05.770
What will you do, Lucia?

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:08.080
Will you really complete that ritual?

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:11.430
But you have to throw your most treasured possession into the sea.

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:14.810
Lucia, what do you plan on throwing into the sea?

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:20.470
The most precious thing I have is this ring that Kaito gave me.

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:22.470
D-Don't do that, Lucia!

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:26.030
That ring is a precious memento of you and Kaito.

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:26.870
That's right.

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.990
I'm sure that fortune-teller is a con-artist!

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:34.680
She gets lots of information out of people by using something like hypnosis.

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:36.830
Don't worry, I know.

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:39.700
I know better than to do something stupid like that.

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:45.320
But I wonder if it would be worth it, if Kaito could recover his memories at the cost of this ring.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:50.370
That kind of miracle isn't likely to exist.

00:09:52.870 --> 00:09:54.780
Ah, oh no!

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:57.950
I promised Onee-chan that I would help her.

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:59.100
I have to go!

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:13.570
I feel really stupid to have come here.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.040
I shouldn't believe in miracles.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:21.150
Those are the girls from the Fortune Love House.

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:26.580
They came here to throw their most treasured possession into the sea.

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:38.580
But what if miracles really do happen and Kaito could recover his memories?

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:53.120
Lucia!

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:58.740
What's wrong, Lucia?

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:02.130
I dropped the ring Kaito gave me into the sea.

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:03.180
Eh!?

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:05.180
Oh no! We have to hurry and get it back.

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:05.780
It's okay.

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:06.650
Lucia.

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:11.320
Maybe a miracle could happen.

00:11:12.140 --> 00:11:14.000
It will definitely happen!

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:36.790
Was it a really good idea to throw the ring into the sea?

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:38.790
Oh no! Don't think about it.

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:42.020
The goddess of fortune will definitely smile upon me.

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:44.020
All that's left to do now is to just believe in it.

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:52.950
Yahoo!

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:54.730
I knew you'd still be awake.

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:56.110
Rina! Hanon!

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:57.970
What are you doing so late at night?

00:11:57.970 --> 00:12:04.230
To tell you the truth, I was wondering if that spell had any effect, so I couldn't sleep.

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:09.050
We thought you might not able to sleep, either.

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:12.900
Why don't we stay up and chat for a while?

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:17.060
Over snacks and juice from the kitchen.

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:18.240
That's a good idea.

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:20.240
Hanon. Rina.

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:24.950
They're always around to comfort me when I'm worried.

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:26.950
Then that settles it.

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:28.950
Let's have a pajama party!

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:32.630
Huh? What are you doing!?

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:35.950
You know, we hold a pajama party mainly to have a pillow fight.

00:12:35.950 --> 00:12:36.920
Really?

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:39.220
Whatever! Take that!

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:43.020
Lucia.

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:45.980
Rina!

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:47.870
You asked for it now!

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:04.960
It's time to show you what I can do.

00:13:05.140 --> 00:13:10.070
The goddess of fortune will now spread misfortune in her wake.

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:16.630
I'll be waiting, Mermaid Princesses, to give each of you a kiss of reunion!

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:37.450
I can't wait to see Kaito at school!

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:40.080
I haven't been this excited in a long time.

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:42.530
I'm glad that she's fine.

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:45.800
That ritual was worth completing if it cheers her up this much.

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:49.750
What's going on?

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:52.330
This is where the Love Fortune House was yesterday.

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:53.070
How cruel.

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:53.940
What is this?

00:13:53.940 --> 00:13:55.060
I can't forgive this!

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:56.720
What was she doing?

00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:57.440
Huh?

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:59.040
The Love Fortune House is gone.

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:01.210
There's something written on that sign.

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:02.950
Let's see.

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:05.170
"The fortune-teller and the ritual are fake."

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:07.340
"If you regret what you did, then go to the sea and pick what you threw away."

00:14:07.340 --> 00:14:09.340
"Everyone who was deceived are fools."

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:11.750
Someone who calls someone a fool is the real fool! Fool! Fool! Fool!

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:14.360
The fortune-teller and the ritual are fake.

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:16.090
Hey, let's go pick them up.

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:18.440
Yeah. They may still be there!

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:19.430
Let's go! Let's go!

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:22.570
I'm going too! I have to find my ring!

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:23.440
Lucia!

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:25.300
What's wrong, Rina?

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:29.240
Hanon, don't you think it's strange that she disappeared right after we met her?

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.780
Then do you think that this is a trap?

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:34.780
I think there's a very good chance that it is.

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:36.840
Then Lucia's in danger!

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:37.630
Yeah.

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:38.090
Let's hurry!

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:44.750
It was stupid of me to believe in the goddess of fortune.

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:48.400
It was stupid of me to throw that treasured ring from Kaito into the sea!

00:14:50.390 --> 00:14:52.560
Where's the ring?

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:55.830
You really came, Mermaid Princess.

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:11.170
You're Lady Bat!

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:14.300
You were the fortune-teller, weren't you?

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:18.800
I was sure a lovesick Mermaid Princess would be lead on by a fortune-teller specializing in love,

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:22.040
and would throw her most treasured possession into the sea.

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:24.970
What did you say?

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:30.590
Once she realized the fortune-teller was a fake, she'd surely come to find her most treasured possession.

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:31.480
I won't forgive you!

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:35.870
You got too many girls involved and made them all throw their most treasured possessions away!

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:36.810
Lucia!

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:38.090
Are you all right?

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:39.670
It really was a trap.

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:56.850
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:02.160
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:06.470
Green Pearl Voice!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:07.050
Lady Bat, you should shed more tears than those girls did!

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:10.990
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:22.700
I-It hurts!

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:24.030
I can't raise my voice.

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:25.300
We can't sing.

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:29.360
This is the power of Mikeru-sama's ball of light.

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:50.850
Where are we?

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:52.280
We're in Mikeru's dimension.

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:54.680
What are you going to do? Let us go!

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:59.830
Mikeru-sama, as you ordered, I brought you the Mermaid Princesses.

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:01.830
Well done, Lady Bat.

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:05.600
That's Seira's compact!

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:06.600
Give it back!

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:08.150
Threatening me like that won't solve anything.

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:14.330
Be quiet and watch as my powers grow.

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:17.980
I'll deal with you at my leisure after that.

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:27.240
What?

00:18:50.800 --> 00:18:51.440
Seira!

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:02.280
Mikeru's dimension disappeared.

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:05.930
Seira set us free.

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:09.020
What have you done to Mikeru-sama!?

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:10.730
Look at what you did.

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:14.230
You should suffer the same pain those girls did.

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:15.960
You deserve twice as much, so brace yourself!

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:50.700
I forgot to read my own fortune!

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:03.430
I have the absolute worst luck today!

00:20:29.050 --> 00:20:31.300
Love Shower Pitch!

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:35.990
How about an encore?

00:20:35.990 --> 00:20:38.500
You have amazing luck today!

00:20:50.260 --> 00:20:51.770
Thank you, Lucia.

00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:58.840
This is how you feel when you devote yourself to someone you love and would do anything for them.

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:03.170
Seira.

00:21:18.230 --> 00:21:23.000
In the end, the ring was swept away and we couldn't find it.

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:25.000
I feel sorry for Lucia.

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:26.470
Huh?

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:27.650
Kaito's coming.

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:28.980
Lucia.

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:31.020
Kaito. What's wrong?

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:33.020
This is yours, isn't it?

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:35.020
That's...

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:36.610
You dropped it on the beach.

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:53.730
Isn't this ring your most treasured possession?

00:21:53.730 --> 00:21:55.010
Don't lose it again.

00:21:57.990 --> 00:22:00.440
Okay. I won't ever lose it again!

00:22:00.440 --> 00:22:03.480
I'll definitely treasure it!

00:22:03.680 --> 00:22:06.010
The ritual was a fake...

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:10.730
...but it seems the goddess of fortune smiled on her a bit.

00:23:51.480 --> 00:23:53.190
It must be nice being an idol.

00:23:53.480 --> 00:23:56.280
I want to debut and receive the attention that comes with it, too!

00:23:56.280 --> 00:23:59.900
Oh my. Something like that is impossible for someone like you who isn't cute.

00:23:59.900 --> 00:24:01.020
What did you say!?

00:24:01.020 --> 00:24:06.410
Being an idol is something only someone as lovely as I, Alala, can do.

00:24:06.410 --> 00:24:08.000
That makes me mad!

00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:11.470
Do you mean that the era of the Mermaid Princesses has come to an end?

00:24:12.180 --> 00:24:14.960
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:15.310 --> 00:24:16.620
Idol Debut.

00:24:16.620 --> 00:24:19.410
Alala is going to become an idol!
